{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売の『UTB＋』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん、愛未、中田の\n3人で撮影してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで撮ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう1パターンあるんだけど\nセクシーな感じなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット載せてないから\n『UTB＋』で見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\nらりんか愛未が載せるかもしれないけど\nそれはそれで置いといて(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューは\n武道館への意気込みも載ってるので\n武道館前に是非、読んでください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この撮影の後、\nみんなでお寿司行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＪＲ渋谷駅のハチ公口に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パナソニック充電池\n乃木坂46応援チャージプロジェクト\nの特設ボードがあります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月30日からあったんだけど\n中田の番がやって来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充電池を1本持っていって\nそこにセットすれば\n応援メッセージが聞けるんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥のもあるので\n飛鳥推しのみなさんは良かったら\nついでに中田のも聴いてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷駅のハチ公改札を出てすぐのとこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からだったんだけど\n入れ替わっちゃう前に行ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田も行きたい！\n変装して行こっかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は乃木坂浪漫イベントだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった皆さま、待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/7496856/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}